OL,3,GNEWSATower Ballroom to host
OL,4,Ailluminations watch party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people who missed out on
OL,7,Ftickets to attend a concert ahead of
OL,8,Fthe Blackpool Illuminations switch-on
OL,9,Fwill be able to apply for tickets for a
OL,10,Fparty inside Blackpool Tower instead.
OL,12,FBritish pop band Five will perform
OL,13,Falongside rock quintet The Feeling and
OL,14,Fchart-topping singer-songwriter Lucy
OL,15,FSpraggan at this year's switch-on
OL,16,Fconcert.
OL,18,FThe outdoor event will take place on
OL,19,Fthe Tower Festival Headland on 4
OL,20,FSeptember, in the shadow of The
OL,21,FBlackpool Tower, and will mark the
OL,22,Fstart of the illuminations season.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
